## Example only — copy to `.env.local` and fill in. Never commit real keys.
## WARNING: Vite inlines VITE_* variables into the built JavaScript, which means
## anyone can read them in the deployed app. For a public release put the key in
## a server proxy (e.g. a Firebase Cloud Function) instead.
VITE_SUPPORT_AI_KEY=sk-your-deepseek-key-here
